t.","Students stopped talking to one another during tasks."],"answer":"Fewer small interruptions meant less time was lost.","answerKey":"C","rubric":null,"sourceMaterial":null,"responseConstraints":null,"primaryEvidence":null,"taskletPosition":3,"bankVersion":"pilot-0.2","qualityStatus":"approved_for_pilot","psychometricStatus":"uncalibrated"},{"externalId":"R-B1-003-Q4","level":"B1","skill":"reading","category":"Reading","topic":"technology","genre":"personal_article","audience":"teen","taskletExternalId":"R-B1-003","subskill":"writer_attitude","difficulty":4,"taskType":"multiple_choice","questionType":"multiple_choice","prompt":"Which statement best describes the writer’s final view?","options":["The experiment was useful without being a complete solution.","The experiment should become compulsory in every school.","The experiment failed because exceptions were necessary.","The experiment permanently changed the writer’s phone use."],"answer":"The experiment was useful without being a complete solution.","answerKey":"A","rubric":null,"sourceMaterial":null,"responseConstraints":null,"primaryEvidence":null,"taskletPosition":4,"bankVersion":"pilot-0.2","qualityStatus":"approved_for_pilot","psychometricStatus":"uncalibrated"},{"externalId":"R-B2-003-Q1","level":"B2","skill":"reading","category":"Reading","topic":"work","genre":"opinion_article","audience":"adult","taskletExternalId":"R-B2-003","subskill":"writer_stance","difficulty":4,"taskType":"multiple_choice","questionType":"multiple_choice","prompt":"Which statement best represents the writer''s view?","options":["Publishing salary ranges can improve scrutiny, but it does not by itself guarantee fairness.","Salary ranges should replace individual negotiation in all recruitment.","Salary transparency mainly benefits employers by reducing interview time.","Publishing pay information creates more problems than it solves."],"answer":"Publishing salary ranges can improve scrutiny, but it does not by itself guarantee f