driven to the station.","She expected to dislike it but now enjoys it."],"answer":"She expected to dislike it but now enjoys it.","answerKey":"D","rubric":null,"sourceMaterial":null,"responseConstraints":null,"primaryEvidence":null,"taskletPosition":3,"bankVersion":"pilot-0.2","qualityStatus":"approved_for_pilot","psychometricStatus":"uncalibrated"},{"externalId":"L-B1-001-Q4","level":"B1","skill":"listening","category":"Listening","topic":"work","genre":"interview","audience":"adult","taskletExternalId":"L-B1-001","subskill":"speaker_intention","difficulty":4,"taskType":"multiple_choice","questionType":"listening","prompt":"Why does Nina say ''The train isn''t perfect''?","options":["to acknowledge a disadvantage before giving her overall positive view","to suggest that the presenter has misunderstood her answer","to complain that train services have become less reliable","to explain that she plans to return to driving soon"],"answer":"to acknowledge a disadvantage before giving her overall positive view","answerKey":"A","rubric":null,"sourceMaterial":null,"responseConstraints":null,"primaryEvidence":null,"taskletPosition":4,"bankVersion":"pilot-0.2","qualityStatus":"approved_for_pilot","psychometricStatus":"uncalibrated"},{"externalId":"L-B1-002-Q1","level":"B1","skill":"listening","category":"Listening","topic":"culture","genre":"radio_interview","audience":"general","taskletExternalId":"L-B1-002","subskill":"main_points","difficulty":3,"taskType":"multiple_choice","questionType":"listening","prompt":"Why did the festival introduce payment wristbands?","options":["to collect information about which bands people watched","to stop food stalls from changing their prices","to reduce queues and the amount of cash handled by sellers","to encourage visitors to buy tickets online"],"answer":"to reduce queues and the amount of cash handled by sellers","answerKey":"C","rubric":null,"sourceMaterial":null,"responseConstraints":null,"primaryEvidence":null,"taskletPosition":1,